# High-Performance Numerical Algorithms & Systems Portfolio

Welcome to my technical portfolio. I specialize in bridging advanced mathematical modeling with high-performance software implementation—writing robust, cache-efficient, and memory-optimized code tailored for modern CPU and GPU architectures.

---

## 🔬 Core Competencies & Topics

### 1. Mathematical Optimization & Inverse Problems
* **Convex Optimization & Consensus:** Implementation of primal-dual algorithms, consensus optimization, and distributed solvers.
* **Sparse Representations:** Orthogonal Matching Pursuit (OMP), K-SVD dictionary learning, and sparse SVD solvers.
* **Regularization & Variational Methods:** Total Variation (TV) minimization and gradient-domain methods for ill-posed inverse problems.

### 2. Signal Processing & Approximation Theory
* **Spherical Basis & Filter Design:** Advanced spectral analysis, spherical harmonic approximations, and custom filter bank implementations.
* **Nonlinear Approximation & Taylor Models:** Rigorous bounded function approximations and validated numerics.

### 3. Machine Learning & Deep Learning Architectures
* **Neural Networks:** Custom architectures spanning CNNs, RNNs, and deep representation learning.
* **Kernel Methods & Radial Basis Functions (RBF):** Meshfree interpolation, RBF network solvers, and related numerical algorithms.

### 4. Hardware-Aware Systems & Performance Engineering
* **Cache & Memory Bandwidth Optimization:** Designing algorithms sensitive to CPU cache lines, TLB behavior, and memory hierarchy.
* **GPU Computing:** High-throughput parallel processing aligned with modern GPU execution models.
* **Lockless Data Structures:** Concurrency-safe, wait-free/lock-free memory structures for high-frequency or multi-threaded pipelines.

